# =========================
# Stage-1 is stateless: no DB, no on-disk run store. Any leftover local data
# from a prior build is ignored, not tracked. Databases of any kind are a
# build artifact here, never source — backend/local.db and data/recon_store
# were both tracked before the deploy cleanup and must not come back.
# =========================
data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# =========================
# Build / tooling caches. dist/ and node_modules/ are covered above; these are
# the ones that silently reappeared on this branch.
# =========================
.turbo/
storybook-static/
*.vsix